@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@eventGridToken = REPLACE_WITH_EVENTGRID_TOKEN

### Private notification endpoint; only reachable internally in Compose
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{eventGridToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"id":"assignment-notification-1","eventType":"EditorAssigned","subject":"manuscripts/REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_ID","eventTime":"2026-10-31T14:00:00Z","dataVersion":"1","data":{"tenantId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111","sequence":2,"manuscriptId":"REPLACE_MANUSCRIPT_ID"}}]

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
